# TS optimisation for the nucleophilic attack. Start from the highest point of
# the relaxed scan (orca_scan_OC.allxyz -> extract that frame to ts_guess.xyz).
# The optimised TS is written to orca_ts.xyz and its Hessian to orca_ts.hess.
# Calc_Hess computes the exact Hessian before the first step; Hybrid_Hess
# { ... } (exact Hessian only for the listed atoms) is a cheaper alternative.
! B3LYP D3BJ def2-SVP def2/J RIJCOSX CPCM(water) TightSCF OptTS Freq

%pal nprocs 16 end
%maxcore 3000

%cpcm
  epsilon 4.0
end

%geom
  Calc_Hess true
  MaxIter 200
  Constraints
@ORCA_FIX@
  end
end

%freq
  QuasiRRHO true
end

* xyzfile 1 1 ts_guess.xyz
